# toolbar, a 644 by 399 dialog whose ToolBar holds the icon buttons Close and View and the toggles Start, Pause and Stop of one check box
# group (each 34 across from 12, at 20 down), and Help at the right: Start, then Pause, then Stop are pressed in turn, the group keeping one
# down; the pointer leaves the bar in each step so that no tooltip shows. The program has no quit of its own (its Close button is wired to
# nothing), so the road ends it
click 1 62 20
move 300 300
wait
click 1 96 20
move 300 300
wait
click 1 130 20
move 300 300
